Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:32:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/18] feat(core): tiers, model policy and model access for
 harness agents

Coding Harness task agents express model and effort as `model:` and
`thinkingLevel:` frontmatter. Add the harness tier-projection column
(judgment and templated inherit, balanced pins medium like the other
markdown surfaces), the model-policy writer and drift reader for
.harness-aidlc/host/agents, the harness honesty row (every effort is
native), the tierFlavor, and harness-owned model access with a
`harness` >= 1.1.0 CLI probe.
